id: pm-7msh7k
title: Preserve telemetry identity and runtime acceptance across Node and npm versions
description: GitHub issue #1258 reports Node 22 nightly failures in collector concurrency and rejected-source JSON acceptance. SQLite ExperimentalWarning contaminates strict stderr assertions. Preserve exact application-warning and delivery checks while controlling only the known runtime warning at subprocess launch.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
