completed_at: "2026-09-14T13:52:05.899Z"
author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: Both telemetry subprocess suites pass on Node 22 and current Node; unexpected stderr still fails; exact lifecycle pairs and rejection privacy remain verified
parent: pm-5oj5
resolution: "Refresh telemetry identity inside queue transactions, preserve strict Node 22 stderr checks, normalize supported npm receipts, and register a hosted Node 22 telemetry job"
expected_result: "Stable installation identity, portable real npm acceptance and Node 22 telemetry regressions"
actual_result: "137 direct Node 22 telemetry tests and linked 4/78/40-test selections pass; full typechecking, 8871 tests and exact 100/100/100/100 coverage pass; hosted PR checks remain required before merge"
