comments[10]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-14T12:29:21.921Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete 2759-item all-status CLI export with no omissions plus exact GitHub URL and SQLite-warning matching found no canonical owner for issue 1258. Prior queue and source-attribution work is closed and reused as typed lineage."
  "2026-09-14T12:35:01.430Z","harness:codex","TDD evidence: both failing suites reproduced under Node 22.21.1 with the exact SQLite ExperimentalWarning in stderr. Subprocess launch now disables ExperimentalWarning only; exact application stderr and no-private-value assertions remain unchanged."
  "2026-09-14T12:52:50.639Z","harness:codex","Full-suite follow-up: Node warning suppression passes focused tests, but concurrent collector integration exposed two installation IDs across four processes under coverage load. Investigating settings snapshots across queue lock acquisition; no identity assertion will be removed."
  "2026-09-14T12:54:24.219Z","harness:codex","Deterministic negative control reproduced identity replacement when a pre-lock settings snapshot carried post-peer signatures. Queue transactions now invalidate their installation settings cache after acquiring the mutex, so consent and identity are re-read from disk. The real four-process collector assertion remains mandatory."
  "2026-09-14T13:00:42.306Z","harness:codex","Focused verification: all 150 telemetry/workflow tests and all 78 affected package/CLI acceptance tests pass. npm receipt parsing tests now accept either array or keyed object receipts while requiring exactly one actual archive. Prior product parser fix pm-xrjy8o remains closed and shipped. This item verifies that contract in real npm-dependent acceptance."
  "2026-09-14T13:05:06.147Z","harness:codex","Live released-artifact verification found an additional npm 12 receipt mismatch: npm view version/dist metadata returns a singleton array, but verify-published-release expects an object and retries a package already published. Stopped unnecessary retries after directly confirming version and integrity. Extending the same runtime-compatibility delivery to normalize one metadata receipt and reject ambiguous arrays."
  "2026-09-14T13:07:50.001Z","harness:codex","Live verification now succeeds for published 2026.9.14 with npm-attempts=1 and executor-attempts=1: npm metadata, npx/bunx CLI dispatch, MCP stdio and HTTP discovery, Skills/Apps resources, missing-bin negative controls, complete bin coverage, and public non-draft GitHub release. Regression suite passes 40 tests; pre-fix negative controls failed 7 cases."
  "2026-09-14T13:25:17.825Z","harness:codex","Release acceptance evidence: npm 12 returns a singleton array for npm view metadata. Seven new negative/positive cases failed before normalization; all 40 release-verifier tests pass after accepting only an object or singleton object array, rejecting ambiguous shapes. Live v2026.9.14 verification now passes registry integrity, GitHub release, npx/bunx default dispatch, MCP stdio/HTTP and resource acceptance. This verifies the existing published release, not this unmerged branch."
  "2026-09-14T13:50:36.483Z","harness:codex","Final validation: 8871 tests in 692 files passed at exact 100/100/100/100 coverage. Linked runs passed 4 telemetry subprocess tests, 78 workflow/real npm package acceptance tests and 40 published-release verifier tests. Full source/package/example/SDK typechecking passes. Final tarball passed temporary npm and Bun consumers plus npx/bunx smoke. Hosted Node 22 and security checks will be independently evaluated on the PR head before merge."
  "2026-09-14T13:52:00.159Z","harness:codex","Direct Node 22 validation passed all 137 telemetry tests using the built artifact and Node 22 runtime. The current Node run, temporary npm/Bun consumers, exact full coverage and linked test receipts also pass. Hosted PR-head checks remain independently required before merge."
